Adapted Code — CC BY 4.0

The trim detection logic in the shader templates (texture sampling
pattern, trim lighting branch structure, PER_FACE_LIGHTING / ALPHA_CUTOUT /
NO_OVERLAY preprocessor blocks, and apply_fog call) is adapted from:

  Emissive Trims by Bluebird
  https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/emissive-trims

This adapted portion is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution
4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0). To view a copy of this license,
see LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0.txt or visit https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The adapted code has been extended with dynamic pulse effects including
waveform generation, ripple mapping, chroma shift, flash cycling, dual-layer
modulation, noise, environmental light response, hue rotation, and saturation
adjustment.
